    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><br>Em segunda-feira, 3 de junho de 2019 14:02:09 UTC-4, jonnations  escreveu:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Everyone,</div><div><br></div><div>I realize there have been a few posts on this topic, <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/bioc-ggtree/height_0.95_HPD%7Csort:date/bioc-ggtree/4DdgTc1ZL2U/65P6dWYLAwAJ\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!searchin/bioc-ggtree/height_0.95_HPD%257Csort:date/bioc-ggtree/4DdgTc1ZL2U/65P6dWYLAwAJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482227586000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zz-T8uDySWQm1M-Gh2XDu\">HERE</a> for example, but I still haven&#39;t seen an answer that works for my problem. I am plotting a time-calibrated BEAST2 tree with `height_0.95_HPD` values at the nodes. I am reversing the axis using `revts()`. When I do this, the x-axis reverses, but the height_0.95_HPD values do not reverse. See reproducible example below. If you look closely you can see that the node height values do not reverse. <br></div><div><br></div><div>I realize that this may be tricky, but does anyone know how to &quot;reverse&quot; the height_0.95_HPD values before or during plotting? <br></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much!</div><div>Jon<br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>example 1</div><div><br></div><div>mac, ggtree version 1.14.6<br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>file </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata/BEAST&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;beast_mcc.tree&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;treeio&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>beast </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">beast</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ggtr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">beast</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> theme_tree2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   geom_range</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">range</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;height_0.95_HPD&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;height&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ggtr<br></span></div></code></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/3e39fa2a1eeb0/Screen%20Shot%202019-06-03%20at%2010.54.15%20AM.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1&amp;authuser=0\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-06-03 at 10.54.15 AM.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"278\"></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>example 2<br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ggtr2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> revts</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggtr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ggtr2<br></span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/3e39fa2a1eeb0/Screen%20Shot%202019-06-03%20at%2010.52.57%20AM.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1&amp;authuser=0\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-06-03 at 10.52.57 AM.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"278\"></p><div><br></div><div><br>example 3<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ggtr3 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">beast</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ggtr3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><spa